<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="DeepFake-AI Antigravity" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="diag_SpatioTemporalArchitecture" name="SpatioTemporalArchitecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1280" pageHeight="800" background="#0a0f1d" math="1" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="node_2" value="&lt;b&gt;16-Frame Video Sequence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Temporal Frame Sequence&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Video Volume: [B, T=16, C=3, H, W]&lt;br&gt;• Inter-Frame Interval: Δt = 33.3ms&lt;br&gt;• Continuous Facial Alignment&lt;br&gt;• Captures Biological Rhythms:&lt;br&gt;    - Eye Aspect Ratio Blinks&lt;br&gt;    - Lip Boundary Kinematics&lt;br&gt;    - Blood Volume Pulse (rPPG)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#38bdf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[[B, 16, 3, 224, 224]]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="220" width="260" height="300" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_3" value="&lt;b&gt;Time-Distributed Conv Stem&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Per-Frame Spatial Representation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Reshape: [B * 16, 3, 224, 224]&lt;br&gt;• Conv2d(3→32, k=3, s=2, p=1):&lt;br&gt;    Spatial Subsampling to 112x112&lt;br&gt;• Activation: ReLU(inplace=True)&lt;br&gt;• Adaptive Pooling: AdaptiveAvgPool2d((4, 4))&lt;br&gt;• Flattening per frame: 32 * 4 * 4 = 512-dim&lt;br&gt;• Sequence Reshape:&lt;br&gt;    x_seq ∈ R^[B, 16, 512]&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#818cf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[[B, 16, 512]]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="340" y="180" width="340" height="380" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_4" value="&lt;b&gt;Bidirectional LSTM Aggregator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Forward &amp;amp; Backward Context&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• PyTorch nn.LSTM:&lt;br&gt;    input_size = 512&lt;br&gt;    hidden_size = 128&lt;br&gt;    num_layers = 1&lt;br&gt;    batch_first = True&lt;br&gt;    bidirectional = True&lt;br&gt;• Forward Hidden State: h_fwd ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;• Backward Hidden State: h_bwd ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;• Terminal State Concatenation:&lt;br&gt;    h_T = [h_fwd_T || h_bwd_T] ∈ R^256&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#c084fc;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[h_T ∈ R^256]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="720" y="180" width="300" height="380" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_5" value="&lt;b&gt;Linear Classifier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Temporal Decision&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Linear(256 → 2)&lt;br&gt;• Output Logits:&lt;br&gt;    [logit_real, logit_fake]&lt;br&gt;• Detects Inter-Frame Jitter &amp;amp; Flickering&lt;br&gt;• Latency: 4.8ms&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#34d399;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[Binary Logits]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#062e1e;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1060" y="250" width="180" height="240" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_6" value="[B, 16, 512]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#818cf8;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_3" target="node_4"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>